## 6. Create Materialized View
```sql
CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW students_by_email AS
  SELECT * FROM students
  WHERE email IS NOT NULL AND studentId IS NOT NULL AND createdAt IS NOT NULL
  PRIMARY KEY (email, studentId, createdAt);


